{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dear Marie,\n\nI am in Brussels at the house of Mr. van Ghert, who is taking me in for the night. When I arrived last evening, I hurried straight to the post office, but the counters were already closed. So I had to sleep without any news from home. This morning I learned that since the last dispatch in Cassel, no further letter from you has arrived.\n\nThe day here is quiet. The weather is cool, and the city seems somewhat quieter compared to Berlin, although the streets are lively. I have wandered through the lanes for a long time to enjoy the atmosphere. It is a pleasant change after the strain of the journey.\n\nI hope that Karl and Immanuel are well and that school is going well. Please let me know when you read this. I miss you both very much in this faraway city.\n\nYour faithful G. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221067,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":186,"prompt_tokens":280,"total_tokens":466,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-RKA5wDhcDel5E51VpNcvNC7TFP3WlIUm","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":280,"prompt_ms":513.074,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.8324071428571427,"prompt_per_second":545.7302455396298,"predicted_n":186,"predicted_ms":4327.307,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.390848648648646,"predicted_per_second":42.75176223919403}}